  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "company": "FAANG",
  "premium": false,
  "question": "Companies often perform salary analyses to ensure fair compensation practices. One useful analysis is to check if there are any employees earning more than their direct managers.\n\nAs a HR Analyst, you're asked to identify all employees who earn more than their direct managers. The result should include the employee's ID and name.",
  "notes": [
    "The output shows that Olivia Smith earns \\$7,000, surpassing her manager, William David who earns \\$6,800.",
    "The dataset you are querying against may have different input & output - this is just an example!"
  ],
